{
 "id": 1776102,
 "titulo": "11/15 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1668499222902,
 "modificada": 1733399057713,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1776102",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1642484088451\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fb6d1abccb364a5981c9cb4a33768459_1642484088451_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents!&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Through this November Additional Patch,&nbsp;<br>\ntwo Super Heroes who have devoted all they have got&nbsp;<br>\nto fight against crime and war will show new abilities!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Tier-4 Advancement and a new Uniform for <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Captain America</span>,<br>\nand Tier-3 Advancement and a new Uniform for <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Punisher </span>have been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out the new skills and powers of the two Super Heroes<br>\nby downloading the 11/15 Patch!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">■ 11/15 Patch Details</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><s><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Patch Schedule: 11/16 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 11/15 (Tue) 19:00 (PST)&nbsp;</span></span></s></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">[11/16 (Wed) 3:03 (UTC+0), 11/15 (Tue) 19:03 (PST) added]</span></p>\n\n<p>The patch has been completed as of 11/16 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 11/15 (Tue) 19:00 (PST).&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Please reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances<br>\nand the </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#27ae60;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">completion time will be announced</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"> once the patch has been finished.<br>\n* The patch will be applied in waves, so the application time may vary by Agent.<br>\n* The game can still be accessed during the patch.<br>\n* When the patch is done, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Two New Uniforms</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out the abilities of the two new Uniforms,<br>\nthe original look of the symbol of justice, Captain America &lt;Back to Basics&gt;,<br>\nand the demonic fist who would bust crimes, Punisher &lt;Fist of the Beast&gt;.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The two new Uniforms can be purchased after the 11/15 Patch data is applied&nbsp;<br>\nand a 50% discount event will be applied to the new Uniforms.<br>\n* The new Uniforms can be found and purchased in the Marvel Universe and the Uniform Room.<br>\n* New Uniform Skills are based on the following skill Level stats.<br>\n(Tier-4 heroes: Lv. 10, Others: Lv. 6)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1780\" id=\"1668494234189\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/e8a6a15ef7eb46779c8d4a58e003117e_1668494234189_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1428\" id=\"1668494234202\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/8aa676c6c01147649ea5e0db1cc888e5_1668494234202_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Punisher Tier-3</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Punisher is now available for Tier-3 Advancement.<br>\nPunisher will wipe out crime more ruthlessly with his new powers.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"347\" id=\"1668492062081\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/403b75c325e14d459164cab0229026bd_1668492062081_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-156ac3f8-7fff-d62b-b0d4-f86d9f18ae93\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"170\" src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/kq4gCnHscC_awfEeJQkO0HKr3ixV_ofXKjtOuZiSGBhwIUeijactoTuU4wh9avz8a3otRbleo_TaBX4ZRDT9IJxvhtFtumZJtsXw-o-IAnZ4_jxMefsORA2OEMn3Uf9yf09yxKkTkvU0QjNv93ftVvF5YVBB_eSUPrDY-NgsIWp3upm9_q_CDhpDyVS2tETY\" width=\"305\"></b><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Captain America Tier-4</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Captain America has gained new powers<br>\nto stand as the symbol of justice who never falls down.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The effects are based on Skill Level 6 stats.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"281\" id=\"1668492117325\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/f0a54c2bab4046c4a19b0a150f3e8550_1668492117325_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ New Artifacts</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A new Artifact has been added for Punisher.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The effects are based on the 6★ Artifact passive skill Level 4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"358\" id=\"1668494990614\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/85042c8660384176a95465b7ad20c3df_1668494990614_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Black Bolt Tier-4 Striker Skill Changes</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. The Tier-4 skill of Black Bolt has been changed.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The effects are based on Skill Level 6 stats.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1668496055912\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/12481833e85443b1a7732b477362505d_1668496055912_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Other Improvements and Changes</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. The issue of some words being wrongly displayed in some languages has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We look forward to your active participation in the events&nbsp;<br>\nthat will be held to support the growth of the updated Super Heroes.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1668491918180\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/6ca205521d3d45c1862e7b082426001b_1668491918180_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n"
